r):\n        bad+=1\n        print(\"DIFF\",repr(p[:80]),\"C=\",a.stdout,a.returncode,\"R=\",b.stdout,b.returncode)\n        if bad>10: break\nprint(f\"fuzz: {n} cases, {bad} divergences\")\nPY\ntimeout 600 python3 \"$TMPDIR/fuzz.py\" 6000","description":"Run 6000-case grammar fuzz across both binaries"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":800,"cache_read_input_tokens":152260,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":800,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"48be53e8-e7f1-4c70-a7a7-6c40e01deca5","uuid":"c422c302-361a-465a-b4a2-6473e2f03f16","timestamp":"2026-08-18T12:55:35.131Z"}
